<Configuration>
  <!--
    Chay thu SolaSub tren mot ban Windows SACH (Windows Sandbox).
    Trong do khong co Python, khong co VC++ Redistributable, khong co gi het —
    dung bang may client that.

    Can bat tinh nang truoc (mo PowerShell bang quyen Admin, roi khoi dong lai):
        Enable-WindowsOptionalFeature -Online -FeatureName "Containers-DisposableClientVM" -All

    Chay:  nhay doi vao file .wsb nay.
    Ket qua ghi ra:  <du an>\build\sandbox\ketqua\

    QUAN TRONG: Windows Sandbox CHI nhan duong dan tuyet doi, khong co bien.
    Neu ban dat du an o cho khac D:\SolaTTS\SolaSub thi phai sua 2 duong dan
    <HostFolder> ben duoi cho khop.

    Muon thu ca buoc can chinh that thi dat mot cap file mau ten short.mp3 va
    short.txt (van ban goc cua chinh doan audio do) vao build\sandbox\mau\.
    Khong co thi kich ban tu bo qua buoc do.
  -->
  <MappedFolders>
    <MappedFolder>
      <HostFolder>D:\SolaTTS\SolaSub\installer\Output</HostFolder>
      <SandboxFolder>C:\bocai</SandboxFolder>
      <ReadOnly>true</ReadOnly>
    </MappedFolder>
    <MappedFolder>
      <HostFolder>D:\SolaTTS\SolaSub\build\sandbox</HostFolder>
      <SandboxFolder>C:\kichban</SandboxFolder>
      <ReadOnly>false</ReadOnly>
    </MappedFolder>
  </MappedFolders>

  <LogonCommand>
    <Command>powershell.exe -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -NoProfile -File C:\kichban\chay-test.ps1</Command>
  </LogonCommand>

  <!-- 8 GB de du cho ban GPU neu muon thu ca CUDA -->
  <MemoryInMB>8192</MemoryInMB>
  <Networking>Enable</Networking>
  <vGPU>Disable</vGPU>
</Configuration>
